    "sections": {
        "description": "The Events and Celebrations Theme provides a structured layout for presenting event-related information in an organized format. It includes responsive design support, customizable color and typography settings, and flexible homepage sections that can be arranged through the customizer. The theme is built to display schedules, announcements, galleries, featured content, and contact details with clear spacing and navigation. Multiple page templates, widget areas, and menu locations are included to support different site layouts. The responsive structure helps maintain usability across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Featured images and content sections can be managed through standard editing tools, while plugin compatibility allows additional functionality such as forms, galleries, and online store features. Header, footer, and homepage settings can be adjusted without modifying code, making it easier to tailor the appearance of the site. The design emphasizes readability, content organization, and compatibility with commonly used website features while providing a flexible foundation for event-oriented websites."
    },
